\label{LemaExponencial2}
Let $S_2(t)=e^{\mathcal{B}_2t}$  be a $C_0$-semigroup on contractions on Hilbert space $\mathcal{H}=\mathcal{H}_2$,  the solutions of the system \eqref{Eq01B2}--\eqref{Eq09A} satisfy the inequality
