To show the \eqref{EstimaExponential} inequality,  it suffices to show that,  given $\delta>0$ there exists a constant $C_\delta>0$ such that  the solutions of the system  \eqref{Eq01B2}--\eqref{Eq09A} for $|\lambda|>\delta$ satisfy the inequality
