\mu_1\|A^\frac{\tau}{2}\Phi\|^2+\mu_2\|A^\frac{\sigma}{2} \Psi\|^2+\gamma\|A^\frac{\xi}{2}\Theta\|^2= \text{Re}\langle{(i\lambda -\mathcal{B}_2)U},{U}\rangle= \text{Re}\langle{F},{U}\rangle\leq \|F\|_\mathcal{H}\|U\|_\mathcal{H}.
