From  estimative \eqref{dis-10B}  and the fact $0\leq\frac{\tau}{2},\;0\leq\frac{\sigma}{2}$ and $0\leq\frac{\xi}{2}$  the continuous embedding $D(A^{\theta_2}) \hookrightarrow D(A^{\theta_1}),\;\theta_2>\theta_1$,  result in 
